      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FIFTY THREE STARS (3) had to dig deep to salute last start over 1660m at this track, getting home by just 1.1 metres. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Meets a similar line up so he can certainly win again. FLYING COLOURS NZ (2) drew a wide gate last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 9 metres into sixth at this track over 2138m. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. STILLYOURSHOT NZ (5) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when he finished second at Redcliffe over 1780m. VINCHESKA (7) must be considered after she finished third over 1780m at Redcliffe eight days ago after racing parked-out at the bell.",
